        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 12 Inch Decorative Acrylic Glass Door Handles</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe detailed filigree end brackets of this truly unique decorative glass  door handles will add incredible beauty to your bathroom shower doors.<br>\r\nDetailed picture of the filigree end brackets below.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-urn-tip-bracket.jpg?v=1704442273\" width=\"275\" height=\"275\" border=\"0\" alt =\"detailed urn tip filigree end brackets\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest  acrylic available. The acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. Available in your choice of <b>Frosted or Crystal Clear Acrylic </b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions FSD-MGRBURNAx-12 Acrylic Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 12-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Finest Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These  shower door handles are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including other <b>sizes and finishes</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door handles and includes the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "12 Inch Decorative Acrylic Glass Door Handles, Pair, First Impressions FII-SD-MGRBURNAx-12",
                "description": "First Impressions 12 Inch Decorative Acrylic Shower Door Pulls. The detailed filigree end brackets of this truly unique decorative glass shower door pull will add incredible beauty to your bathroom. Available in your choice of Frosted or Clear Acrylic.",
